   "fen": "rnbqk2r/pppp1ppp/5n2/2b1p3/3PP3/2N2N2/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 0 4",
   "line": [
    "d4"
   ],
   "spoken": "d4 — a souped-up Scotch; at least it's a fresh position."
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
   "t": 66.5,
   "fen": "rnbqk2r/pppp1ppp/5n2/2b5/3pP3/2N2N2/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 0 5",
